      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seneca_Rocks",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1839, the Sites family built a pen log cabin under the towering Seneca Rocks, the earliest known permanent settlement in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
