      "source": "https://www.appalachianforestnha.org/america250-in-the-appalachian-forest-stories/seneca-rocks",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The South Peak is the only peak on the East Coast that can only be reached by technical rock climbing, making it a unique challenge for climbers.",
